flowchart TD

    Start["Business Operation<br/>Example: Payment Completed"]


    subgraph Transaction["Database Transaction"]

        Service["Go Domain Service"]

        UpdateDB["Update Business Data<br/>Example: billing.transactions"]

        CreateEvent["Create Outbox Event<br/>shared.outbox_events"]

        Commit["Commit Transaction"]

    end


    Signal["Redis Pub/Sub Signal<br/>event_signal:<domain>"]


    Worker["Background Worker<br/>Go Goroutine"]


    ReadEvent["Read Pending Outbox Events"]

    Process["Process Event<br/>Example: Send Email / Update Academy"]

    Complete["Mark Event Completed"]


    Failed["Retry Counter Increment"]

    DLQ["Dead Letter State<br/>Manual Review"]



    Start --> Service

    Service --> UpdateDB

    UpdateDB --> CreateEvent

    CreateEvent --> Commit


    Commit --> Signal


    Signal --> Worker


    Worker --> ReadEvent

    ReadEvent --> Process


    Process --> Complete


    Process --> Failed

    Failed --> Worker

    Failed --> DLQ